BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Set the first-month gross cash-spend ceiling at $7,500 before committing contractor work. Allocate $2,500 to overhead,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm ($2,500 to specialist payments, $750 to software and API usage, $750 to acquisition activity, and $1,000 to contingency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (These envelopes sum exactly to the ceiling; using the contingency requires removing the amount from its remaining) Tj ET
