BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (economically. For planning, add a $5,000 founder-labor charge if that labor is unpaid during launch, producing $12,500) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (of modeled first-month cost before any further accruals. Do not add that charge twice when allocating delivery labor) Tj ET
