BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (delivery and 80 for sales, administration, and support. Cap contractor usage at 60 combined hours, with actual rates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (reconciled to the $2,500 envelope before booking. If specialist rates consume the cash allowance earlier, cash controls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (the limit. Reserve at least 40 delivery hours for defects and handover. Run one live implementation at a time during) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (launch rather than converting theoretical hours into overlapping customer promises.) Tj ET
